[en.CHARACTER_MARE_DO_WELL_3_NAME]
Mare Do Well 3

[en.CHARACTER_MARE_DO_WELL_3_DESC]
“And to think, after all this time, they still believe I’m ‘Mare Do Well’, as if ‘Mare Do Well’ could be an individual working alone, so classic.”

[zh.CHARACTER_MARE_DO_WELL_3_NAME]
义勇神驹

[zh.CHARACTER_MARE_DO_WELL_3_DESC]
“真没想到，到现在，他们还一直以为我是‘义勇神驹’，好像‘义勇神驹’是一只单独的小马只靠自己能够做到的一样，真是经典。”
